  "solution": {
    "text": "The correct order of the rate of esterification of these acids with MeOH is 1 &gt; 2 &gt; 3 &gt; 4. <br/>The mechanism of esterification is <br/><img src=\"assets\\st0053_de5ce1883779.jpeg\" style=\"max-width:100%; object-fit:contain\" style=\"width:3.85in;height:2.2in\"> <br/>As the size of the substitution on <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">α</mi></math> -carbon increases, the tetrahedral bonded intermediate becomes more crowded. The greater the crowding, the slower is the reaction."
